Your company runs critical workloads on GKE and wants to ensure that nodes in the cluster are always running the latest security patches. You want to minimize disruption to running workloads. What should you do?

A. Configure the GKE cluster to use the Regular release channel and enable node auto-upgrade with a surge upgrade strategy.
