Your organization uses Cloud Logging. Compliance requirements mandate that certain log types must be retained for 7 years. The default retention period in Cloud Logging is not sufficient. What should you do?

A. Configure a log sink to export the logs to a Cloud Storage bucket and set the bucket's retention policy to 7 years.
