Your organization wants to implement a software supply chain security practice that ensures container images deployed to production have been reviewed and approved by a security team member. What should you do?

A. Require all container images to be stored in Artifact Registry and configure IAM so only the security team can push images.
B. Use Binary Authorization with an attestation policy that requires a human attestation from the security team before an image can be deployed to production.
