C: Incorrect. Cloud Armor controls network traffic and cannot enforce approval workflows for container image deployments.
D: Incorrect. Manual approval via a chat message is not enforceable or auditable. There is no cryptographic proof that a reviewed and approved image is the same one that gets deployed.

