C: Incorrect. Caching responses indefinitely would serve stale data and is not appropriate for most dynamic APIs.
D: Incorrect. Asynchronous processing via Cloud Tasks changes the user experience from synchronous to asynchronous, which may not be acceptable for real-time user-facing requests.

